---

## Build Process

1. Designed and routed the circuit in KiCad.
2. Printed the copper layout.
3. Transferred the pattern onto a copper-clad board.
4. Etched away the extra copper.
5. Drilled the holes for the components.
6. Soldered the components onto the board.
7. Tested the circuit with a 9V battery.

